1
00:00:00,245 --> 00:00:02,328
Archimedes! Is my crown pure gold—or fake?

2
00:00:02,625 --> 00:00:04,552
One catch—melt the King's crown, and you're history!

3
00:00:04,975 --> 00:00:07,231
A gold bar is easy—but how do you measure spiky curves?

4
00:00:07,525 --> 00:00:09,546
Rulers fail, calipers slip—and geometry gives up!

5
00:00:09,975 --> 00:00:12,325
Then Archimedes hops into a brim-full bath—splash!

6
00:00:12,625 --> 00:00:14,954
Eureka! My body pushes out its exact volume of water!

7
00:00:15,375 --> 00:00:17,725
Cheat with lighter silver—and the crown must be bulkier!

8
00:00:18,025 --> 00:00:20,140
Look! The crown spills way more water than pure gold!

9
00:00:20,575 --> 00:00:22,536
Busted! The sneaky goldsmith stuffed silver inside!

10
00:00:22,975 --> 00:00:25,137
Upward buoyant push equals the weight of displaced water!

11
00:00:25,575 --> 00:00:27,355
That one bath unlocked why giant steel ships float!

12
00:00:27,825 --> 00:00:29,658
Never underestimate a genius—and a bubble bath!
